"""Rental shop media shelf audit.

Books and DVDs are modeled as nodes with their own typed abilities;
unclassified items (e.g. archive reels) fall through to a default
audit handler. The walker tallies total items seen and how many hit
the default path.
"""

node MediaItem {
    has title: str = "";
}

